      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Factor the smaller power 2^(n+2):\n\n2^(n+2)(4−1)=192\n2^(n+2)=64=2^6\nn=4\n\nOnly the exponent gap 2 matters inside the bracket.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
